+UCLIN .
+ADD DLIBZONE(DLB1) SREL(Z038) RELATED(TGT1) .
+ENDUCL .
+```
+
+Entries are read with `LIST` and updated with `UCLIN`:
+
+```
+SET BDY(TGT1) .
+LIST MAC .
+LIST SYSMODS .
+```
