+## Invoking SMP/E
+
+SMP/E runs as a batch program, from the SMP/E dialogs under ISPF, or through a cataloged procedure. All three end up running `GIMSMP`.
+
+Minimum DDs:
+
+| DD | Use |
+|---|---|
+| `SMPCSI` | The CSI holding the global zone (`DISP=SHR`) |
+| `SMPCNTL` | SMP/E commands |
+| `SMPOUT`, `SMPRPT`, `SMPLIST`, `SMPSNAP`, `SMPDEBUG` | Output |
+| `SMPPTFIN`, `SMPHOLD` | Input for RECEIVE; both DDs are required for RECEIVE, and `SMPHOLD` may be `DUMMY` |
+| `SMPPUNCH` | Output for GENERATE, REPORT and UNLOAD |
+| `SMPWRK1`-`SMPWRK6`, `SYSUT1`-`SYSUT4` | Work files, usually supplied by DDDEF entries |
+
+Other DDs (PTS, SCDS, LOG, library DDs) are normally supplied through DDDEF entries in the zones, not in the JCL.
+
+Sample cataloged procedure:
+
+`labs/env/proc/SMPPROC.jcl` - member `SMPPROC` - verified: no
+
+```jcl
+//SMPPROC  PROC
+//SMP      EXEC PGM=GIMSMP,REGION=0M,PARM='DATE=U'
+//SMPOUT   DD SYSOUT=*
+//SMPRPT   DD SYSOUT=*
+//SMPLIST  DD SYSOUT=*
+//SMPSNAP  DD SYSOUT=*
+//SMPDEBUG DD SYSOUT=*
+//SMPPUNCH DD SYSOUT=*
+//SMPCSI   DD DSN=SMPE.LAB.CSI,DISP=SHR
+//SMPCNTL  DD DUMMY
+//         PEND
+```
+
+Run a command through the procedure:
+
+`labs/m01/jcl/M01-RUNPROC.jcl` - member `RUNPROC` - verified: no
+
+```jcl
+//SMPEJOB  JOB (ACCT),'SMPE',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=H
+//         JCLLIB ORDER=SMPE.LAB.PROCLIB
+//RUN      EXEC SMPPROC
+//SMPCNTL  DD *
+  SET BDY(GLOBAL) .
+  LIST SYSMODS .
+/*
+```
+
+Three ways to invoke:
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    A[Need to run SMP/E] --> B{How?}
+    B -->|Batch JCL| C[EXEC PGM=GIMSMP or cataloged procedure]
+    B -->|Interactive| D[ISPF SMP/E dialogs]
+    B -->|Program or script| E[Generate JCL and submit - REXX]
+    C --> F[Read SMPOUT, SMPRPT]
+    D --> F
+    E --> F
+```
+
+Return codes follow SMP/E conventions: 0 successful, 4 warnings, 8 errors in at least one SYSMOD or entry, 12 more serious errors, 16 or higher severe errors (not all SYSMODs processed). Message IDs have the form `GIMnnnnnX`, where the last letter is the severity (I information, W warning, E error, S severe).
+
+### REXX: build and submit a GIMSMP job
+
+`rexx/SMPEJOB.rexx` - member `SMPEJOB` - verified: no
+
+```rexx
+/* REXX SMPEJOB - build and submit a one-step GIMSMP job            */
+/* Usage: SMPEJOB zone command                                     */
+/* Example: SMPEJOB TGT1 APPLY SELECT(UA00001) CHECK .             */
+parse arg zone cmd
+if zone = '' | cmd = '' then do
+  say 'Usage: SMPEJOB zone command'
+  exit 8
+end
+hlq = 'SMPE.LAB'
+uid = userid()
+tmp = uid'.SMPEJOB.JCL'
+jcl.1  = '//'left(uid'S',8)" JOB (ACCT),'SMPE',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=H"
+jcl.2  = '//SMP      EXEC PGM=GIMSMP,REGION=0M,PARM='||"'DATE=U'"
+jcl.3  = '//SMPOUT   DD SYSOUT=*'
+jcl.4  = '//SMPRPT   DD SYSOUT=*'
+jcl.5  = '//SMPLIST  DD SYSOUT=*'
+jcl.6  = '//SMPSNAP  DD SYSOUT=*'
+jcl.7  = '//SMPDEBUG DD SYSOUT=*'
+jcl.8  = '//SMPCSI   DD DISP=SHR,DSN='hlq'.CSI'
+jcl.9  = '//SMPCNTL  DD *'
+jcl.10 = '  SET BDY('zone') .'
+jcl.11 = '  'cmd
+jcl.12 = '/*'
+jcl.0  = 12
+"DELETE '"tmp"'"
+"ALLOC F(SMPJCL) DA('"tmp"') NEW CATALOG REUSE",
+      "RECFM(F B) LRECL(80) BLKSIZE(3120) SPACE(1 1) TRACKS"
+"EXECIO" jcl.0 "DISKW SMPJCL (STEM jcl. FINIS)"
+"FREE F(SMPJCL)"
+"SUBMIT '"tmp"'"
+exit rc
+```
+
+### REXX: summarize SMP/E output
+
+`rexx/SMPESCAN.rexx` - member `SMPESCAN` - verified: no
+
+```rexx
+/* REXX SMPESCAN - count GIM messages by severity in SMPOUT         */
+/* Usage: SMPESCAN 'your.smpout.dataset'                            */
+parse arg dsn
+if dsn = '' then do
+  say 'Usage: SMPESCAN dataset'
+  exit 8
+end
+"ALLOC F(SMPIN) DA("dsn") SHR REUSE"
+"EXECIO * DISKR SMPIN (STEM ln. FINIS)"
+"FREE F(SMPIN)"
+sev. = 0
+highrc = ''
+do i = 1 to ln.0
+  w = word(ln.i,1)
+  if left(w,3) = 'GIM' & length(w) = 9 then do
+    s = right(w,1)
+    sev.s = sev.s + 1
+    if s = 'E' | s = 'S' then say strip(ln.i)
+  end
+  p = pos('HIGHEST RETURN CODE WAS',ln.i)
+  if p > 0 then highrc = word(substr(ln.i,p+23),1)
+end
+say 'Information :' sev.I
+say 'Warnings    :' sev.W
+say 'Errors      :' sev.E
+say 'Severe      :' sev.S
+say 'Highest RC  :' highrc
+if sev.S > 0 then exit 16
+if sev.E > 0 then exit 8
+if sev.W > 0 then exit 4
+exit 0
+```
